{"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["iOS","iPadOS","Mac Catalyst"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"onPictureInPictureChange"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"_"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"internalParam","text":"handler"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"attribute","text":"@escaping"},{"kind":"text","text":" ("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb","text":"Bool"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida","text":"Void"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"content":[{"level":2,"anchor":"discussion","type":"heading","text":"Discussion"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The adapter MUST also invoke the handler once, synchronously or on the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"next main-queue turn, with the CURRENT state at install time. The"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"adapter outlives the SDK session (one player, many sessions), so a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"transition that lands between sessions — the previous session’s window"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"closing late, the next one not yet initialized — is otherwise consumed"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"by the adapter’s own change-dedup with nobody listening, and the new"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"session starts believing the window is closed while the player is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"presenting in it (measured on the iOS e2e fleet, catalog-pip"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"PIP-ENTER-DURING-* @ 0.50.0-beta.506). The renderer’s dedup makes the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"install-time delivery idempotent, so adapters need not special-case"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"“nothing changed”."}],"type":"paragraph"}],"kind":"content"}],"kind":"symbol","metadata":{"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method","title":"onPictureInPictureChange(_:)","required":true,"modules":[{"name":"OptiViewAdsCore"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"onPictureInPictureChange","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"((","kind":"text"},{"text":"Bool","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Sb"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Void","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s4Voida"},{"text":")","kind":"text"}],"externalID":"s:15OptiViewAdsCore09PictureInE7CapableP02onefE6ChangeyyySbcF"},"schemaVersion":{"major":0,"minor":3,"patch":0},"sections":[],"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/optiviewadscore.OptiViewAdsCore\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsCore","doc:\/\/optiviewadscore.OptiViewAdsCore\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsCore\/PictureInPictureCapable"]]},"variants":[{"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}],"paths":["\/documentation\/optiviewadscore\/pictureinpicturecapable\/onpictureinpicturechange(__)"]}],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Install the single observer for presentation-mode changes. The handler"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"receives "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"true"},{"type":"text","text":" when the window opens and "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"false"},{"type":"text","text":" when it closes,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whoever drove the transition. Installing replaces any previous handler."}],"identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/optiviewadscore.OptiViewAdsCore\/documentation\/OptiViewAdsCore\/PictureInPictureCapable\/onPictureInPictureChange(_:)"},"references":{"doc://optiviewadscore.OptiViewAdsCore/documentation/OptiViewAdsCore/PictureInPictureCapable/onPictureInPictureChange(_:)":{"type":"topic","abstract":[{"text":"Install the single observer for presentation-mode changes. The handler"